    "updated_at": "2017-02-22T08:14:46Z",
    "body": "One point you did not mention is that with `ImageBitmap` it is not observable to the developer (other than performance) that a copy was made, whereas with `SharedArrayBuffer` it's very much observable. That makes me prefer error as well.",
