    "body": "As a heads up, this PR is effectively replaced by these PRs:\r\n* #2520: change ownership model of workers and shared workers. Without this change we cannot define agent clusters.\r\n* #2521: define agents and agent clusters.\r\n* #2530: define messageerror.\r\n* #2518: adjust StructuredSerialize and StructuredDeserialize, as well as add StructuredSerializeForStorage (for Indexed DB and Notifications).\r\n\r\nPlease take into account that these PRs build upon each other to some extent, so there's some overlap in commits. That'll be reduced as they start landing on master. Also the above list is in order of stability.",
